    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DECK COLLECTOR is the ultimate card collecting simulator designed for those who love to rip open packs of cards! Whether you\u2019re looking to build your collection, chase those rare finds, or to just relax and enjoy the excitement of opening packs of cards, DECK COLLECTOR will fully immerse you in the collectible card world!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Collection</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rip open packs, preconstructed decks, and booster boxes to build your master collection of cards. Add cards into 3D binders to view the progress of each set.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633390/extras/ec09987a46922a772167c04c6e8995bb.poster.avif?t=1751591793\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633390/extras/ec09987a46922a772167c04c6e8995bb.webm?t=1751591793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633390/extras/ec09987a46922a772167c04c6e8995bb.mp4?t=1751591793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ultra Realism</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DECK COLLECTOR was made with realism and performance in mind. The game uses PBR graphics to simulate the look and feel of the real world. The foil shaders were designed to mimic the glimmer of the iconic holographic cards. Rotate the card and watch it come to life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633390/extras/557fbe356d3b7f19ead0793a2023bc94.poster.avif?t=1751591793\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633390/extras/557fbe356d3b7f19ead0793a2023bc94.webm?t=1751591793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633390/extras/557fbe356d3b7f19ead0793a2023bc94.mp4?t=1751591793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Room</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move around the room and place objects. Use the edit tool to precisely edit the position and rotation of all objects. Add posters, convas art, emissive lights, TV\u2019s, monitors, furniture and more to fully immerse yourself in the game and make it your own! Place cards in 3D binders with a FIRST OF ITS KIND page-offset to mimic the real world binders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633390/extras/51d73ce05285d319783d003fbf96046b.poster.avif?t=1751591793\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633390/extras/51d73ce05285d319783d003fbf96046b.webm?t=1751591793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633390/extras/51d73ce05285d319783d003fbf96046b.mp4?t=1751591793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Settings! Settings! Settings!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A multitude of settings have been implemented into the game to allow for user controllability. Choose your color, adjust the pacing, and fine-tune the camera settings to your liking. All settings are in plain text inside a text file for easy editing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633390/extras/ae53406cc729143314f985c8a14dd571.poster.avif?t=1751591793\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633390/extras/ae53406cc729143314f985c8a14dd571.webm?t=1751591793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633390/extras/ae53406cc729143314f985c8a14dd571.mp4?t=1751591793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Constant Updates</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will constantly evolve into a bigger, better game. With constant updates, new features, and surprises that will be implemented within the game to enhance the gameplay and overall playability. Difficulty modes, grading, selling cards, an ABUNDANCE of new cards and sets, more settings, player customizations, advanced play modes, VR support, Steam achievements, and SO MUCH MORE are currently on the \u201cto-do\u201d list while the game journeys through its Early Release Mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633390/extras/68e21033f6d815872678eda2b48cab63.poster.avif?t=1751591793\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633390/extras/68e21033f6d815872678eda2b48cab63.webm?t=1751591793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633390/extras/68e21033f6d815872678eda2b48cab63.mp4?t=1751591793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your collection by placing cards in 3D binders with a FIRST OF ITS KIND page-offset for ultra realism</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple sets, packs, and decks of cards to open</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >View each card in stunning detail with ultra realistic holographic foils</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >User controllability through the settings page</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All settings files are in plain text format for easy editing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic graphics using PBR</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Import your own Rooms and Objects to play in game!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >View your progress of each set and deck</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinematic camera with THOUSANDS of combinations for cinematic video</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your color to colorize your game!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Changeable images for some backgrounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D posters and canvas art where you can use your own photos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Image and text import style mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control the look of the game with camera settings (color adjustments, bloom, depth of field, vignette, etc\u2026)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Import textures for Lens Dirt and Overlays</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto-focus depth of field</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free-play style gameplay, open as many packs as you want!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go to the store to buy objects, products, furniture, binders, trading cards, lights, TVs, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump in now to crack open some packs!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DECK COLLECTOR is the ultimate card collecting simulator designed for those who love to rip open packs of cards! Whether you\u2019re looking to build your collection, chase those rare finds, or to just relax and enjoy the excitement of opening packs of cards, DECK COLLECTOR will fully immerse you in the collectible card world!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Collection</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rip open packs, preconstructed decks, and booster boxes to build your master collection of cards. Add cards into 3D binders to view the progress of each set.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633390/extras/ec09987a46922a772167c04c6e8995bb.poster.avif?t=1751591793\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633390/extras/ec09987a46922a772167c04c6e8995bb.webm?t=1751591793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633390/extras/ec09987a46922a772167c04c6e8995bb.mp4?t=1751591793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ultra Realism</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DECK COLLECTOR was made with realism and performance in mind. The game uses PBR graphics to simulate the look and feel of the real world. The foil shaders were designed to mimic the glimmer of the iconic holographic cards. Rotate the card and watch it come to life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633390/extras/557fbe356d3b7f19ead0793a2023bc94.poster.avif?t=1751591793\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633390/extras/557fbe356d3b7f19ead0793a2023bc94.webm?t=1751591793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633390/extras/557fbe356d3b7f19ead0793a2023bc94.mp4?t=1751591793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Room</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move around the room and place objects. Use the edit tool to precisely edit the position and rotation of all objects. Add posters, convas art, emissive lights, TV\u2019s, monitors, furniture and more to fully immerse yourself in the game and make it your own! Place cards in 3D binders with a FIRST OF ITS KIND page-offset to mimic the real world binders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633390/extras/51d73ce05285d319783d003fbf96046b.poster.avif?t=1751591793\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633390/extras/51d73ce05285d319783d003fbf96046b.webm?t=1751591793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633390/extras/51d73ce05285d319783d003fbf96046b.mp4?t=1751591793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Settings! Settings! Settings!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A multitude of settings have been implemented into the game to allow for user controllability. Choose your color, adjust the pacing, and fine-tune the camera settings to your liking. All settings are in plain text inside a text file for easy editing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633390/extras/ae53406cc729143314f985c8a14dd571.poster.avif?t=1751591793\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633390/extras/ae53406cc729143314f985c8a14dd571.webm?t=1751591793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633390/extras/ae53406cc729143314f985c8a14dd571.mp4?t=1751591793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Constant Updates</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will constantly evolve into a bigger, better game. With constant updates, new features, and surprises that will be implemented within the game to enhance the gameplay and overall playability. Difficulty modes, grading, selling cards, an ABUNDANCE of new cards and sets, more settings, player customizations, advanced play modes, VR support, Steam achievements, and SO MUCH MORE are currently on the \u201cto-do\u201d list while the game journeys through its Early Release Mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633390/extras/68e21033f6d815872678eda2b48cab63.poster.avif?t=1751591793\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633390/extras/68e21033f6d815872678eda2b48cab63.webm?t=1751591793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633390/extras/68e21033f6d815872678eda2b48cab63.mp4?t=1751591793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your collection by placing cards in 3D binders with a FIRST OF ITS KIND page-offset for ultra realism</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple sets, packs, and decks of cards to open</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >View each card in stunning detail with ultra realistic holographic foils</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >User controllability through the settings page</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All settings files are in plain text format for easy editing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic graphics using PBR</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Import your own Rooms and Objects to play in game!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >View your progress of each set and deck</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinematic camera with THOUSANDS of combinations for cinematic video</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your color to colorize your game!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Changeable images for some backgrounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D posters and canvas art where you can use your own photos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Image and text import style mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control the look of the game with camera settings (color adjustments, bloom, depth of field, vignette, etc\u2026)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Import textures for Lens Dirt and Overlays</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto-focus depth of field</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free-play style gameplay, open as many packs as you want!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go to the store to buy objects, products, furniture, binders, trading cards, lights, TVs, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump in now to crack open some packs!</p></li></ul>",
